version  1.4.0.0  |  2017-11-30  |  Voice System Package 4.52.1
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CHG Changed connecting to the Linux clock framework. [VOICECPE_SW-1491]
CHG For gcc >= 4.9 do not use __DATE__ and __TIME__ macros anymore to prevent
    a compiler warning. [VOICECPE_SW-1491]
CHG Cleanup compatibility warnings from automake/autoconf [VOICECPE_SW-1445]
FIX VCODEC FW download fails after reboot [VOICECPE_SW-1426]
NEW Ioctl for firmware download SDD_MBX_FW_DOWNLOAD
CHG Select tar-pax format for distribution tarball. [VOICECPE_SW-1332]

