version  1.2.0.0  |  2016-04-20  |  Voice System Package 4.44 RC1
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEW Added new file "lantiq,grx500-vcodec.txt" to the doc subdirectiory which
    contains the description of the needed devicetree node. [VOICECPE_SW-1062]
CHG Changed the devicetree compatibility string to: "lantiq,vcodec-grx500".
FIX Disable proc and dev fs depending from configure options [VOICECPE_SW-1000]
NEW Search for the DC/DC converter type name in the device tree if it is not
    already given as parameter to insmod. [VOICECPE_SW-1035]
CHG Added event logger support for command read, command write and event read.
    [VOICECPE_SW-1000]
CHG Change function split between SDD and SDD-MBX driver [VOICECPE_SW-1000]
NEW Added API to retrieve a string describing the DC/DC converter type. The
    string can be set as parameter "dcdc_type" on insmod. [VOICECPE_SW-1035]
CHG Changed the devicetree compatibility string to: "lantiq,vcodec".
--- Merged Version 1.1.2.0 from branch SP4.40 into the default branch
FIX Removed WITH_VMB_LOADER
--- Increased version to 1.2.x.x
--- Reserved version 1.1.x.x for branch SP_4.40

