version  1.0.5.0  |  2015-10-06  |  Voice System Package 4.36
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FIX Resolved sporadic lock-up situation caused by forgotten events in the
    VCODEC event mailbox. [VOICECPE_SW-1019]
CHG Limited the SPI access to 16 bytes to workaround bug of the XRX500 SPI
    driver which causes the voice to stall. [VOICECPE_SW-1010]
FIX Corrected setting last error variable in FW download. [VOICECPE_SW-1006]
CHG Support for event logger in sdd mbx driver [VOICECPE_SW-993]

